{"id": 99101, "field": "objectives", "ja": "Longwalker Malah's ReportをBaine Bloodhoofに届けてください。", "status": "trusted", "checks": ["names"], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5", "source": "draft-q-quest-objectives-02-sg6@2026-09-18", "imported": "2026-09-18"}, "english": {"hash": "b468c9d14a0813b8", "src": "wdb@1.60.1.70009"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": 99101, "field": "description", "ja": "Baine Bloodhoofが我らの村を率いている。彼にこの侵入のことをすぐに知らせねばならん。\n\nLongwalker Malahの報告書を彼のもとへ持っていけ。町の中心にいるはずだ。\n\nさあ、急げ。一刻の猶予もないぞ！", "status": "trusted", "checks": ["names"], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5", "source": "draft-q-quest-description-03-sg6@2026-09-18", "imported": "2026-09-18"}, "english": {"hash": "7a1841a07dea5cd5", "src": "wdb@1.60.1.70009"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
